# LuxeMarket Intelligence

> A market intelligence platform for luxury vehicles — deal scoring, valuation modeling, and trend analytics.

## Quickstart

```bash
make up       # start Postgres + Redis
make migrate  # run DB migrations
make seed     # seed 1,500 listings
make valuate  # compute valuations + deal scores
make test     # run backend tests
```

## Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|---|---|
| Backend | FastAPI, Python 3.12 |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16 |
| Cache | Redis 7 |
| ML | scikit-learn, pandas |
| Frontend | Next.js 14, React, Tailwind |
| Infra | Docker, GitHub Actions |